fix:
Ensure Value Objects derive or implement structural `PartialEq` and perform deep attribute comparisons instead of address matching.
```rust
#[derive(PartialEq, Eq)]
struct PersonalName {
    first_name: String,
    last_name: String,
}

fn are_names_equal(n1: &PersonalName, n2: &PersonalName) -> bool {
    n1 == n2 // Correct structural attribute comparison
}
```
